<title>USA: GOLF-WEDNESDAY'S SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WEDNESDAY'S SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>INDIAN WELLS, California 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the first round at the $1.5 million Bob Hope-Chrysler Classic golf tournament on Wednesday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>63  Larry Rinker</p>
<p>64  Steve Jones, Mark Calcavecchia</p>
<p>65  Jay Don Blake, Paul Goydos, John Daly, Tommy Tolles</p>
<p>66  Jesper Parnevik (Sweden), Russ Cochran, Fred Funk, John</p>
<p>    Cook, Scott Gump, Len Mattiace, Lee Rinker</p>
<p>67  Jim Gallagher, Guy Boros, Blaine McCallister, Fuzzy</p>
<p>    Zoeller, Phil Tataurangi (New Zealand), Peter Jacobsen, Robert</p>
<p>    Damron, Sandy Lyle (Britain)</p>
<p>Regional scores</p>
<p>68  Grant Waite (New Zealand), Naomichi &quot;Joe&quot; Ozaki (Japan)</p>
<p>74  Fulton Allem (South Africa)</p>
<p>76  Gabriel Hjertstedt (Sweden)</p>
